{"id":"tr-14-034","domain":"wedding seating plan","kind":"translated","session":"tr-14-wedding","names":[],"groups":{},"text":"Good day. My daughter marries in June and it falls to me to make the plan of the tables. Please make on the top one long table for the spouses and the parents.","wires":[{"span":"make on the top one long table for the spouses and the parents","trigger":"make","type":"command","args":{"action":"create","shape":"rectangle","position":"top"}}]}
{"id":"tr-14-035","domain":"wedding seating plan","kind":"translated","session":"tr-14-wedding","names":["rectangle1"],"groups":{},"text":"Under her put please five round tables, all of one size.","wires":[{"span":"Under her put please five round tables, all of one size","trigger":"put","type":"command","args":{"action":"create","count":"5","shape":"circle","position":"below","anchor":"mention(shape=rectangle)"}}]}
{"id":"tr-14-036","domain":"wedding seating plan","kind":"translated","session":"tr-14-wedding","names":["rectangle1","circle1","circle2","circle3","circle4","circle5"],"groups":{},"text":"Give them the numbers from 1 until 5.","wires":[{"span":"Give them the numbers from 1 until 5","trigger":"Give","type":"command","args":{"action":"label","target":"mention(quantifier=all,shape=circle)","label":"1,2,3,4,5"}}]}
{"id":"tr-14-037","domain":"wedding seating plan","kind":"translated","session":"tr-14-wedding","names":["rectangle1","circle1","circle2","circle3","circle4","circle5"],"groups":{},"text":"The long one must have written Young Couple and Parents.","wires":[{"span":"The long one must have written Young Couple and Parents","trigger":"must have written","type":"command","args":{"action":"label","target":"mention(shape=rectangle)","label":"Young Couple and Parents"}}]}
{"id":"tr-14-038","domain":"wedding seating plan","kind":"translated","session":"tr-14-wedding","names":["rectangle1","circle1","circle2","circle3","circle4","circle5"],"groups":{},"text":"Table 3 is the family of the groom, these sit together. Make her green so that I remember.","wires":[{"span":"Make her green","trigger":"Make","type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"mention(label=3,shape=circle)","color":"green"}}]}
{"id":"tr-14-039","domain":"wedding seating plan","kind":"translated","session":"tr-14-wedding","names":["rectangle1","circle1","circle2","circle3","circle4","circle5"],"groups":{},"unreliable":true,"text":"And the number 2 is of my sister. Now I see that she stays very near of the long table and the sister of my husband not, it will be a scandal. Change between them the 2 and the 4.","wires":[{"span":"Change between them the 2 and the 4","trigger":"Change between them","type":"command","args":{"action":"swap","target":"mention(label=2,shape=circle),mention(label=4,shape=circle)"}}]}
{"id":"tr-14-040","domain":"wedding seating plan","kind":"translated","session":"tr-14-wedding","names":["rectangle1","circle1","circle2","circle3","circle4","circle5"],"groups":{},"unreliable":true,"text":"Also the musicians need a place. On the right, near the wall.","wires":[{"span":"the musicians need a place. On the right","trigger":"need a place","type":"command","args":{"action":"create","name":"musicians","position":"right"}}]}
