{"id":"tr-14-044","domain":"wedding seating plan","kind":"complaint","session":"tr-14-wedding","names":["rectangle1","circle1","circle2","circle3","circle4","circle5","musicians","circle6"],"groups":{},"unreliable":true,"text":"There is no door in the drawing, I did not tell you. The door is at the bottom left. You make there one small brown rectangle with the word Door and the table of the children you put beside.","wires":[{"span":"The door is at the bottom left. You make there one small brown rectangle with the word Door","trigger":"make","type":"command","args":{"action":"create","size":"small","color":"brown","shape":"rectangle","label":"Door","position":"bottomLeft"}},{"span":"the table of the children you put beside","trigger":"put beside","type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"mention(color=yellow,size=small)","position":"near","anchor":"$new"}}]}
